data: {"seq":1,"turn_id":"task_a018bb97d9ade783996ae7a5041ed556","type":"turn_created","ts":"2026-11-26T18:20:55.1241+08:00","data":{"deep_research":false,"text":"# Rolling averages omit the final complete window\n\nFix `moving_averages` in `records.py`. For positive `width`, return the\narithmetic mean of every contiguous complete window, including the final one.\nReturn an empty list if the input has no complete window.\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","turn_index":0},"internal":{"source":"host","type":"task_created","task_seq":1,"payload":{"text":"# Rolling averages omit the final complete window\n\nFix `moving_averages` in `records.py`. For positive `width`, return the\narithmetic mean of every contiguous complete window, including the final one.\nReturn an empty list if the input has no complete window.\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","turn_index":0,"deep_research":false}}}

